# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are tracked here. This changelog follows
[Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/) and
[Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/).

## How to use this file

- Keep `## [Unreleased]` at the top and add bullets as changes land.
- On the selected feature branch, move Unreleased into a dated release section
  with the helper's `--mode prep --tag X.Y.Z`; preparation changes content only.
- Use create-pr for repository-wide commits, local review-pr for safe fixes and
  merge-pr for protected Actions approval and merge.
- After actual merge and result CI pass, use `--mode tag` in a clean isolated
  clone at the exact verified result, then `--mode push` with the recorded tag
  object and frozen origin digest. See the helper help for required arguments.
- Release section format:
  `## [__PROJECT_TAG_PREFIX__-vX.Y.Z] - YYYY-MM-DD`

